      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally a 19th‑century mill town along Ridley Creek, Lima still keeps its historic stone houses and quiet suburban feel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
