      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Middletown Friends Meetinghouse, built in 1702, is one of the oldest Friends meetinghouses in what was originally Chester County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
